ared marker.\n+\n+Background checks completed:\n+\n+- Read the imported issue context from `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Checked `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl` to confirm the requested terms did not already exist.\n+- Confirmed the exact parent labels and IDs for `CL_0000624` and `CL_0000625`.\n+- Reviewed the existing `CL_0011025` exhausted T-cell term and local annotation style for new term blocks.\n+- Used the issue references and avoided the incorrect PMID noted in the imported discussion.\n+\n+Validation performed:\n+\n+- Reviewed the exact ontology diff after editing.\n+- Confirmed only `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl` was staged and committed.\n+\n+Commit created locally:\n+\n+- `d998967` `Add exhausted CD4 and CD8 alpha-beta T cell terms`\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added new terms for `CD4-positive exhausted alpha-beta T cell` and `CD8-positive exhausted alpha-beta T cell`, placed directly under the corresponding CD4-positive and CD8-positive alpha-beta T-cell parents rather than under the abstract `exhausted T cell` class, consistent with the issue discussion.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@\n+Added two new CL terms in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`:\n+\n+- `CL_9900001` `CD4-positive exhausted alpha-beta T cell`\n+- `CL_9900002` `CD8-positive exhausted alpha-beta T cell`\n+\n+Rationale:\n+\n+- The issue requested lineage-spe